{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras/76915ea4f63591154d1b059e717bcbc9.avif?t=1759407088\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras_big/76915ea4f63591154d1b059e717bcbc9.webp?t=1759407088 width=1560 height=643 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step aboard the <strong>Sentinel</strong> scientific vessel\u00a0, which sent a distress signal before falling completely silent. As\u00a0<strong>Elara Wynn</strong>, a researcher awakened from cryosleep aboard her own exploration ship, you find yourself at the heart of a mystery waiting to be unravelled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a routine rescue mission, soon becomes a journey through dimly lit corridors, abandoned terminals, and silent decks of the Sentinel. With the ship's AI as your only companion, you uncover fragments of the crew\u2019s stories, read personal messages, and solve logical puzzles to delve deeper into the vessel\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece by piece, you learn what happened on the Sentinel\u2014and why no one is responding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D sci-fi first-person adventure with a focus on exploration and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read emails, search for clues, and decipher codes that gradually reveal the story of the Sentinel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames and logic puzzles that unlock new decks and sealed systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious, quiet atmosphere with steadily increasing tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compact playtime ideal for a single narrative-focused experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras/517ee6b225d406909a0991a63aa612fb.webp?t=1759407088\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras_big/517ee6b225d406909a0991a63aa612fb.webp?t=1759407088 width=1560 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras/bea2039155ed3bab623f00848f3f7f69.poster.avif?t=1759407088\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras/bea2039155ed3bab623f00848f3f7f69.webm?t=1759407088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras/bea2039155ed3bab623f00848f3f7f69.mp4?t=1759407088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras/ed540cbf1ae48ff203c8be40327cfb4a.webp?t=1759407088\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras_big/ed540cbf1ae48ff203c8be40327cfb4a.webp?t=1759407088 width=1560 height=38 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White Whisper combines exploration, logic puzzles, and reading messages in a compact sci-fi narrative with a mysterious atmosphere. With the ship\u2019s AI as your guide, you uncover traces of the crew, decipher codes, and gradually reveal the chilling secrets of the abandoned Sentinel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras/517ee6b225d406909a0991a63aa612fb.webp?t=1759407088\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras_big/517ee6b225d406909a0991a63aa612fb.webp?t=1759407088 width=1560 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras/cfb5e17a7d68aac5703752594a15ef47.poster.avif?t=1759407088\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras/cfb5e17a7d68aac5703752594a15ef47.webm?t=1759407088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras/cfb5e17a7d68aac5703752594a15ef47.mp4?t=1759407088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras/ed540cbf1ae48ff203c8be40327cfb4a.webp?t=1759407088\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras_big/ed540cbf1ae48ff203c8be40327cfb4a.webp?t=1759407088 width=1560 height=38 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zero Gravity:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience zero gravity, where the concept of &quot;up&quot; and &quot;down&quot; loses all meaning. Every movement becomes a new opportunity as corridors and decks open up in unexpected directions, giving exploration a whole new dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras/517ee6b225d406909a0991a63aa612fb.webp?t=1759407088\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994800/extras_big/517ee6b225d406909a0991a63aa612fb.webp?t=1759407088 width=1560 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"b